  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UN Women Somalia 2013-2015 - UNWOMEN participation, WEE, SGBV</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UN Women Somalia 2013-2015</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The UN Women programme includes promotion of women&apos;s leadership in    peace and security, increased political participation, strengthening  womens&apos; economic empowerment and to reduce gender-based violence      against women and girls. Sweden will also support UN Women in         establishing in Somalia.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UN Womens program inkluderar bl a att fr&#xe4;mja kvinnors ledarskap i     fred och s&#xe4;kerhet, &#xf6;ka kvinnors politiska deltagande, st&#xe4;rka kvinnors ekonomiska egenmakt samt minska k&#xf6;nsbaserat v&#xe5;ld mot kvinnor och      flickor. Sverige kommer &#xe4;ven att st&#xf6;dja UN Women i att etablera sig i Somalia.</narrative>
  </description>
